# battle_courses: Battle Trax on Marine Pipe, Port Arena and Toxic Desert;
# player 2 moves the course cursor and pauses; both players retire; the
# round-end menu takes CHANGE COURSE and CHANGE CAR (Coupe and F-Type).
# Power on, GAME SELECTION: BATTLE TRAX; both players keep the 4WD.
